  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GROUNDING Human Rights in Malaysia for All: Embracing change !</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the implementation of relevant CEDAW and UPR concluding observations and recommendations specifically the adoption of the gender equality act that aims to abolish discriminatory laws and policies against women and girls and fulfill the human rights of LGBTIQ community against discrimination and violence in Malaysia.</narrative>
  </description>
